  "body": "## Changelog\n* 3ec1a40e560c2f00ec82c50223add810e2567efb Add notary options\n* 29a7733eca0143880f25753e7f006a82573bcd3a Switch to goreleaser v2\n* dbd5db98e759fde6752b31fff623b2c548379586 Update goreleaser\n* 1b669f6d8a959cf4390b7b5919c60492faf04695 Attempt differing identifier\n* c3a925f7c4bcc23b125a1d17d7284d8756c3222f Attempt rollback to macOS 14\n* d8caa645ccc617e782e86ba9eaa42105c397d224 Revert Apple signing\n* f08d425e16370f3b713b273f3a27aea530c5cf2e Switch to manual signing Apple\n* b8a8c745aeda9ef35ab46cf06d5a6d1920752cd0 Revert Apple signing changes\n* 5487362c7192abb4a92ba667ec8b9266a1999a54 Tweak Apple signer\n* 0878a83e176bf05c9584ba5c0583b65fc0a40785 Specify Apple signing keychain\n* 7fb4e3c9482fe7a7a2ff2251d142aef0ef6786a1 Tweak Apple signing\n* 1c450af4b335758450a29d48fd03249868439339 Debug keychain identities\n* a5070e7f44ec180de41b2a4eb718487406bce7d0 Adjust Apple signing\n* 6466dd526b353a53a163d571c9ac9bd7072ce3b8 Tweak Apple signer\n* 5cf7d6f085129dc201ad56c28795d76a39c2bfa1 Definition update\n* 9a6adc25b2e25d2418dd8ac73dfb17e382ea40f1 Merge pull request #104 from alexveecle/patch-1\n* 8f71714b6a063a78079a49f70bb9825b985c00cd Add note about proxy variables\n\n"
